From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:19:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 64/67] Belt rats: scale by true security, officer and
 commander spawns

Belt spawns compared 1.1 - security with numbers meant for true security, so
high-sec got the hardest spawns and null-sec the easiest. The officer,
commander and hauler roll needed a system above 0.9, where belts don't spawn,
so those never appeared.

- spawn class, Hell spawns and hauler size now follow true security
- officers in null-sec belts, commanders in low and null (battleship
  commanders in null only), haulers anywhere.  New settings OfficerChance
  (0.01), CommanderChance (0.05) and HaulerChance (0.08) in the npc block
- officer and commander groups now pick from all their rows, not the first
- belt rats and site warp-ins start their warp at once from off grid, so a
  battleship no longer spends 20s aligning (and with SleepEmptyBubbles off,
  the idle ai no longer stops the align)
